Welcome! 👋

This repository documents my learning journey through the Microsoft Security, Compliance, and Identity Fundamentals learning plan on Microsoft Learn. 
My goal is to understand the fundamental concepts of security, compliance, and identity  that can help other learners preparing for the SC-900: Microsoft Security, Compliance, and Identity Fundamentals certification.

Microsoft Learn Learning Plan:
https://learn.microsoft.com/plans/p0w4hztdgn8mq0?sharingId=EDAE4CDD4795E21E&wt.mc_id=studentamb_573147

This Learning Plan contains:
Key concepts and important takeaways
Module-wise summaries
Fundamentals of security, compliance, and identity
Useful Microsoft documentation and learning resources for SC-900 preparation

The modules are intended to provide a helpful reference for students and beginners exploring Microsoft security, compliance, and identity solutions.

🎯 Learning Objectives

Through this learning plan, I aim to:
* Understand the fundamentals of security, compliance, and identity
* Learn the basic concepts of Zero Trust and defense-in-depth
* Explore Microsoft Entra ID and identity management
* Understand Microsoft security solutions and capabilities
* Explore Microsoft compliance and governance solutions
* Build a strong foundation for the SC-900 certification

Feel free to explore the modules, learn along with me, and share your suggestions or feedback!
